\par\par \b \uc2 MineCoin  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 : Algo or Human?\b0\par\par\uc2 532 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 2016\par 17:27\par \uc2 PR Newswire\par \uc2 PRN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9  2016  PR Newswire Association LLC.  All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par MinexSystems wants the community to decide whether the Minex Bank should be completely automated or allow human \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 KYIV, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ukraine\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Oct. 13, 2016 /PRNewswire/ -- Minex Systems, invites the community to vote on certain key issues regarding the future \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Minex Bank. Through this voting process, the development team intends to choose between algorithmic, decentralized and human controlled banking models.\f28 \par \par \uc2 Photo - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://photos.prnewswire.com/prnh/20161013/428367"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://photos.prnewswire.com/prnh/20161013/428367}}}\par \par \uc2 Minex Bank is a critical element of Minex Ecosystem. With functions similar to that of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Minex Bank is responsible for the support, stabilization and regulation of the exchange rate of MineCoin against other cryptocurrencies. It is also responsible for handling deposits and financing.\par \par \uc2 The MineCoin development team is currently facing an important question regarding the model of Minex Bank and they would like to get it answered from potential users and holders of MineCoin. They have opted for a voting process to ensure that the trust and transparency in the Minex Ecosystem is maintained throughout the development and implementation process.\par \par \uc2 The question faced by Minex developers revolves around the most suitable and trustworthy banking model for Minex Bank. The development team currently has two options in front of them, one that calls for all the banking functions to be algorithmic and decentralized and other that requires risk monitoring and important decision-making functions to be controlled by humans.\par \par \uc2 The voting process is currently live on MineCoin.org, open for individuals and community members. Soon after logging into the voting tab, the user can vote for either one of the two options suggested by the developers. If the users can think of any other viable alternative to both these options, they can present it to the developers on the same platform.\par \par \uc2 The voting results will be published by Minex on October 31, 2016. Voters offering the "most reasonable" answers will be eligible for MineCoin rewards.\par \par \uc2 In addition, Minex Systems will be testing its Minex Exchange Light on October 21, 2016. Those interested in gaining early access to the Minex Exchange Light platform for testing can request access by registering on the official page of Minex Exchange. Registered users will receive an email with login credentials for the exchange platform.\par \par \uc2 About Minex Systems\par \par \uc2 MinexSystem is a Ukrainian developer of blockchain applications. Currently, the company focuses on the creation of MinexEcosystem, that includes: MinexPlatform, MinexExchange, MinexBank and MinexMarket.\par \par \uc2 Learn more about MinexEcosystem at -- {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.minecoin.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.minecoin.org}}}\par \par \uc2 Media Contact\par \par \uc2 Name: Daniel Shulyaev\par \par \uc2 Email: danielshulyaev@minecoin.org\par \par \uc2 Location: Kyiv, Ukraine\par \par \uc2 MineCoin is the source of this content. Virtual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not legal tender, is not backed by the government, and accounts and value balances are not subject to consumer protections. This press release is for informational purposes only. The information does not constitute investment advice or an offer to invest.\par \par \uc2 Related Links\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin PR Buzz\par \par \uc2 MineCoin\par \par \uc2 This content was issued through the press release distribution service at Newswire.com. For more info visit: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.newswire.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.newswire.com}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 To view the original version on PR Newswire, visit:{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/minecoin-central-bank-algo-or-human-300344317.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/minecoin-\b  \highlight22central-bank\b0 \highlight22 -algo-or-human-300344317.html}}}\par \par \uc2 SOURCE MineCoin\par \par \uc2 /Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.minecoin.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.minecoin.org}}}\par \par \uc2 (END)\par \par \uc2 Dokument PRN0000020161013ecad000gw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
