\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine's foreign reserves rise for first time since September\b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 April 2015\par 17:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds context on reserves, detail on \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , hryvnia)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, April 6 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose for the first time since last September to reach $9.97 billion as of April 1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday, after the \uc2 IMF\uc2  paid out $5 billion under a rebooted bailout programme.\par \par \uc2 A month earlier, reserves stood at $5.63 billion, barely enough to cover one month of imports. They were subsequently boosted by the first tranche of a new four-year bailout package totalling $17.5 billion.\par \par \uc2 "The size of Ukraine's international reserves as of today are sufficient to fulfil the obligations and current \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the government and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the bank said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 It said it had sold $372 million and bought $581 million in \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past month. It has been conducting near-daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the hryvnia \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stable.\par \par \uc2 The hryvnia lost 50 percent in value against the dollar in February, but has since stabilised after the bank hiked rates, launched \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tightened \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls. The official rate stood at around 23.4 to the dollar as of Monday, compared with last month's record highs of over 30. (Reporting by Alessandra Prentice; Editing by Richard Balmforth/Ruth Pitchford) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-4-6T16:40:59.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150406eb4600hdg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
