\par\par \b \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2  satisfied 100 % of the bids for purchase of foreign  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 326 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 2014\par \uc2 ENP Newswire\par \uc2 ENPNEW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014, Electronic News Publishing. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 Release date - 09092014\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2  continues to be an active player in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 , carrying out \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the interbank market with due regard to the impact of all ad hoc factors on the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Yesterday, on September 8, the \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2  sold USD 94 million.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  through direct \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  satisfied 100 % of the bids for purchase of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  (US dollar) submitted by banks.\par \par \uc2 According to Governor of the \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2  Valeriia Gontareva, the regulator will continue to contemplate all available financial instruments that it could deploy not only to stabilize the market but also to build and kick-start it. \u8216\'20\'18The regulator gives confidence to the market players that the market will follow a projected path, paving the way for the successful implementation of a flexible exchange rate regime,\u8217\'20\'19 noted the Governor of the \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As for the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction that was held for the first time since 2010, it was intended to sell foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for hryvnias to satisfy the needs of banks\u8217\'20\'19 clients. US dollars were sold at the exchange rate of UAH 12.90 per USD 1. Overall, the banks that participated in this auction submitted 9 bids.\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18The \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2  expects these targeted \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  auctions to provide stimuli to put the exchange rate of the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmly on an appreciating path and reinforce the positive trends in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market,\u8217\'20\'19 said Governor of the \uc2 National Bank of Ukraine\uc2  Valeriia Gontareva.\par \par \uc2 National bank of Ukraine\uc2  Address: 9 Instytutska St., Kyiv 01601\par \par \uc2 Tel (38 044) 253-01-80, Fax (38 044) 230-20-33, 253-77-50,\par \par \uc2 [Editorial queries for this story should be sent to newswire@enpublishing.co.uk]\par \par \uc2 Dokument ENPNEW0020140910ea9a0001p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
