\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Has No Plans for  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  -Chairman\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alexander Kolyandr   \par \uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 April 2014\par 18:40\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires Chinese (English)\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW--The \uc2 National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't enough \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gold reserves to support the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said the chairman on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We have no plans for \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market, our \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gold reserves are sufficient by the international standards, but not enough to support the hryvnia," Stepan Kubiv wrote on his \uc2 Facebook\uc2  page.\par \par \uc2 He added the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will complete the audit of its reserves by 1 May. The bank said that in mid-March its reserves stood at about $15 billion.\par \par \uc2 Until February, \uc2 Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintained a de facto peg for the hryvnia against the dollar, selling its now heavily-depleted foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves whenever the dollar rose much above 8 to the hryvnia. This policy amid capital outflows driven by mass protests in the center of Kiev and the flagging economy, more than halved the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves since last year.\par \par \uc2 It abandoned the peg as the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  faced heavy selling pressure in response to the country's political unrest, and with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gold reserves at the current low level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  now abstains from \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the flagging \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has lost 36% the dollar since the start of 2014.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Kubiv said he expects the hryvnia will strengthen in 2 to 3 weeks, after the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  approves Ukraine's aid package.\par \par \uc2 Mr. Kubiv said the "hryvnia should mirror the inflation," which is expected to be at 12% to 14% this year, but slow to between 3% and 5% in 2015.\par \par \uc2 Write to Alexander Kolyandr at alexander.kolyandr@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 17-04-14 1640GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020140417ea4h000da\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
